Chapter 13, page 305. The scale with the gismu mnemonics is misaligned with the scale with the members of selma'o CAI. "sai" should be tabbed one place left, so that it aligns with tsali, &c.


chapter 13, section 15. A sample dialogue

15.4) /[[Comment] Pam says, [[Please] Alice, [[end-of-comment]/[[Comment] Pam says, [[end-of-comment] [[Please] Alice,/
((Approved Erratum))

15.10) /fi'i ro zvati ko pinxe pa ckafi/fi'i ro zvati .i ko pinxe pa ckafi/

* No, this one is perfectly fine: "fi'i ro zvati" is a vocative phrase, which is a free modifier, meaning that it can occur almost anywhere.

