Chapter 20, page 505. In "xagmau zo'u tu'e ganai cidja gi cnino .i ganai vanju gi tolci'o ((tu'u))", "cnino" should be replaced by "citno". 

*Also, a prenex can't have a selbri, so ''xagmau'' should be replaced by ''lo xagmau''.


